構えて真正面から睨み合う十七夜とももこ。\n\nセリフ\n十七夜「十咎、前から君と本気で戦ってみたかった。今はもう敵同士、遠慮無く全力でいこう！！」\n十七夜はキレた目で左右の口角が上がったいい笑顔で。\n\nももこ「ああ、あんたの面倒見てやるよ。全力でぶっ飛ばして、目ぇ覚まさせてやる！！」\nももこはブチ切れた顔で叫びながら。\n二人の目のアップを入れて下さると嬉しいです。\n\nよろしくおねがいします！", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@5120Gigabyte/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 133269, "client_id": 1698668, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2055ba29/uploads/origins/a0e41bd4-4838-470f-9e94-b3ffe745a41d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e49d229434630a18611dcd8a956197de", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2055ba29/uploads/origins/a0e41bd4-4838-470f-9e94-b3ffe745a41d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e49d229434630a18611dcd8a956197de, https://si.imgix.net/2055ba29/uploads/origins/a0e41bd4-4838-470f-9e94-b3ffe745a41d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38749806e0d68692a67447c96c934a81 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2055ba29/uploads/origins/a0e41bd4-4838-470f-9e94-b3ffe745a41d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f02f82ea0ef6e1b3770b4f3ec4cee0f2 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2055ba29/uploads/origins/a0e41bd4-4838-470f-9e94-b3ffe745a41d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3f8256b5d4431ebd8b30919871c87c4d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2055ba29/uploads/origins/a0e41bd4-4838-470f-9e94-b3ffe745a41d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3f8256b5d4431ebd8b30919871c87c4d, https://si.imgix.net/2055ba29/uploads/origins/a0e41bd4-4838-470f-9e94-b3ffe745a41d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=226c6abc6600902bb